  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.61,
      "e": 2.6,
      "text": "- [Narrator] With Hurricane Harvey relief efforts underway,"
    },
    {
      "s": 2.6,
      "e": 4.38,
      "text": "the Oklahoma Army National Guard continues"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.38,
      "e": 6.98,
      "text": "to send support forward to the deployed troops"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.98,
      "e": 9.48,
      "text": "throughout various camps in Texas."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.48,
      "e": 11.25,
      "text": "- The overall mission is to help"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.25,
      "e": 14.08,
      "text": "with Hurricane Harvey, the relief."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.08,
      "e": 17.06,
      "text": "We're basically here just to help all the civilians,"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.06,
      "e": 20.68,
      "text": "I mean, water, resources like recovering equipment,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.68,
      "e": 22.38,
      "text": "broken equipment, vehicles."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.38,
      "e": 24.59,
      "text": "We'll be running missions back and forth."
    },
    {
      "s": 24.59,
      "e": 26.33,
      "text": "Like, our first mission was to Beaumont,"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.33,
      "e": 29.59,
      "text": "which was bringing all the tires to Decon Systems."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.59,
      "e": 32.3,
      "text": "We're basically just bringing back supplies"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.3,
      "e": 35.09,
      "text": "and taking back all of their broken equipment."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.09,
      "e": 36.37,
      "text": "It's really about a community."
    },
    {
      "s": 36.37,
      "e": 37.97,
      "text": "I mean, we all come together when things"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.97,
      "e": 39.56,
      "text": "like this happen, like disaster."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.56,
      "e": 41.09,
      "text": "It's not just one unit."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.09,
      "e": 43.46,
      "text": "There's hundreds of soldiers from different units"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.46,
      "e": 46.68,
      "text": "all over the place, from Arkansas, Texas, Oklahoma."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.68,
      "e": 49.41,
      "text": "We're all here and we all come together in support"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.41,
      "e": 50.88,
      "text": "of a natural disaster."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.88,
      "e": 52.95,
      "text": "That's what National Guard is for."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.95,
      "e": 54.61,
      "text": "- [Narrator] Reporting for the Oklahoma National Guard"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.61,
      "e": 55.96,
      "text": "from Beaumont, Texas,"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.96,
      "e": 58.72,
      "text": "I'm Army Sergeant First Class Amber Osay."
    }
  ],
